           MULTIVARIATE RESIDUAL DIAGNOSTICS                
=============================================================

Hosking's Multivariate Portmanteau Test (lag 6):
  Q(33) = 40.9345, p-value = 0.1612
  df = m^2 s - k = 54 - 21, k = dynamic coefficients estimated
  Cannot reject H0: residuals appear white noise.

